      "name": "Design Notes",
      "width": 400,
      "height": 1300,
      "content": "DESIGN REFERENCE NOTES\n========================\n\nDesign pattern: HuggingFace.co\n- Public homepage = hero + trending + features\n- Logged-in = dashboard with personal feed\n- Same nav bar, login becomes avatar\n\nContent source: sdsc-hackathons.ch\n- Hackathon events (ORD, GenAI, Climate)\n- Temporal framework (T-4 to post-event)\n- Registration -> proposals -> teams -> hack\n\nTheme: Hackathonsdsc\n- Monospace font (Source Code Pro)\n- Border radius: 0 (sharp corners)\n- Primary: #6ABF4B (green)\n- Secondary: #5A4D8A (purple)\n- Dark mode default\n\nReusable Components (top row):\n- nav-bar\n- nav-bar-mobile (390px: logo + search icon + menu)\n- footer-main (SDSC + ETH + EPFL logos)\n- footer-main-mobile (stacked, narrow)\n- participant-card\n- proposal-card\n- proposal-card-mobile (stacked CTA)\n- participant-card-mobile (stacked profile CTA)\n- team-card-mobile (stacked members + CTA)\n- team-card\n\nMOBILE (390px viewport, canvas x≈15400–20050):\n- Reusable: participant-card-mobile, team-card-mobile (y≈340/520, w 358)\n- homepage-mobile, page-proposals-mobile, dashboard-mobile, hackathon-page-mobile,\n  hackathon-loggedin-mobile, page-participants-mobile, page-teams-mobile\n- Light mobile: homepage-light-mobile, hackathon-loggedin-light-mobile (theme light)\n- Variables: size.mobileW=390, size.gutterMobile=16\n\nFrames (left to right):\n1. / = Public homepage (1440px, dark)\n2. /welcome = Dashboard (1440px, dark)\n3. /hackathon/[slug] = Detail page (1440px)\n4. /hackathon/[slug] = Logged-in (1440px, dark)\n5. /hackathon/[slug]/participants\n6. /hackathon/[slug]/proposals\n7. /hackathon/[slug]/teams\n8. / = Homepage (LIGHT mode)\n9. /hackathon/[slug] = Logged-in (LIGHT mode)\n10–16. Mobile 390px row (see MOBILE): dashboard,\n    public hackathon, logged-in, participants, teams,\n    homepage-light-mobile, hackathon-loggedin-light-mobile\n\n========================\nHOMEPAGE\n========================\nSections (top to bottom):\n1. Hero — bg photo (ambiance_1.jpg)\n   with dark overlay + centered text\n2. Trending — tabbed list (HF-style)\n3. Winners — 3 showcase cards\n4. Event Showcase — photo carousel\n   (ambiance, teams, winners photos)\n5. Features — 2x2 grid\n6. Orgs — logo row (social proof)\n7. CTA — organize your hackathon\n8. Footer — SDSC + ETH + EPFL logos\n\nConfluence req coverage:\n[x] Current Hackathons/Challenges\n[x] Project & team winners\n[x] Latest Hackathons (in tabs)\n[x] Invitation to register\n[x] Organize your hackathon CTA\n[x] Event photos showcase\n\n========================\nDASHBOARD (/welcome)\n========================\n[x] Active hackathon status + phase\n[x] Current project/team\n[x] Past hackathons & teams\n[x] Notification center\n[x] Settings link\n\n========================\nHACKATHON PAGE (PUBLIC)\n========================\nModular sections (Confluence 7.3):\nAll toggleable by organizer.\n\nSection 1: Hero\n  [x] Title (string)\n  [x] Dates (string)\n  [x] Venue (string)\n  [x] Main photo (url) — gradient bg\n\nSection 2: Organizers\n  [x] Description (string)\n  [x] Logos (list of picture URL)\n\nSection 3: Markdown\n  [x] Markdown formatted text\n  [x] Bold, lists, links, pictures\n\nSection 4: Support Events\n  [x] Titles (list of webinars)\n  [x] Speakers / logos (pictures)\n  [x] Link to more info\n\nSection 5: Highlights\n  [x] Picture (one per block)\n  [x] Message (one per block)\n\nSection 6: Video\n  [x] Title\n  [x] Caption\n  [x] Video url\n\nSection 7: Call to Action\n  [x] Button (link to registration)\n\n========================\nHACKATHON — LOGGED IN\n========================\nFigma ref (functional requirements only):\neUBPuQj0KlWAzIfKEgqpHY\n\nFunctionality extracted from existing site:\n\nNAVIGATION (sub-pages):\n[x] Overview / Home\n[x] All participants list\n[x] Project proposals list\n[x] All teams list\n[x] Submitted projects\n[x] Timeline & Agenda\n[x] Webinars\n[x] Photos\n→ Implemented as horizontal tabs\n  (not old sidebar)\n\nPHASE AWARENESS:\n[x] Phase timeline bar with states:\n    completed / active / upcoming\n[x] From data model: Phase entity\n    (id, hackathon_id, start/end, name)\n[x] Phase-aware CTAs change per step\n\nPARTICIPATION STATUS:\n[x] Registration badge\n[x] Team assignment (name, members)\n[x] Project info (title, track, status)\n[x] Next action CTA with deadline\n→ Maps to: Participant, Team,\n  TeamParticipant, Submission entities\n\nUSER ACTIONS (phase-aware):\n[x] Propose a project\n[x] Set preferences / choose prefs\n[x] Submit project\n[x] Vote for best project\n[x] View profile\n[x] Account settings\n→ Active vs disabled based on phase\n\nTEAM MANAGEMENT:\n[x] Team name + description\n[x] Member list with avatars\n[x] Member roles (owner/member)\n[x] View team page link\n→ Maps to: Team, TeamParticipant\n\nADMIN TOOLS (role-gated):\n[x] Create Hackathon\n[x] Create Team\n[x] Manage Users\n[x] Manage Projects\n[x] Manage Teams\n[x] Manage Votes\n[x] Manage Hackathons\n→ Only shown if User.role = admin\n\nUSEFUL LINKS:\n[x] Previous Hackathons\n[x] About SDSC\n[x] Contact us\n[x] Why Participate?\n\nDATA MODEL coverage:\n[x] User (profile, role, skills)\n[x] Hackathon (name, dates, visibility)\n[x] Participant (registration, waiting)\n[x] Team (name, desc, category, status)\n[x] TeamParticipant (role)\n[x] Submission (status)\n[x] Phase (timeline)\n[x] Category (tracks)\n[x] Vote (best project)\n[x] Page (content sections)\n[x] Settings (max participants, etc.)\n\nSkeleton mapping:\n- Tabs: tab-group / custom flex\n- Phase bar: stepper / custom flex\n- Participation card: card + badge\n- Action buttons: btn preset-filled\n- Team card: card + Avatar\n- Admin links: nav-list or link list\n- Icons: lucide-svelte throughout\n\n========================\nREUSABLE COMPONENTS\n========================\n\nparticipant-card:\n  [x] Avatar (circular, 56px)\n  [x] Name (User.name)\n  [x] Role/Title (User.description)\n  [x] Affiliation (User.affiliation)\n  [x] LinkedIn link (optional)\n  [x] Check profile details btn\n\nproposal-card:\n  [x] Project image (circular, 64px)\n  [x] Numbered title\n  [x] Description paragraph\n  [x] More Info btn\n\nteam-card:\n  [x] Team image (circular, 64px)\n  [x] Team number + name\n  [x] Project description\n  [x] Member avatars with names\n  [x] Edit icon (own team only)\n  [x] More Information btn\n\n========================\nLIST PAGES\n========================\n\nAll Participants:\n  [x] Page title + count\n  [x] Search/filter bar\n  [x] List of participant-card\n  [x] Pagination\n\nAll Proposals:\n  [x] Page title + Propose btn\n  [x] Track filter chips (All, DS, RDI)\n  [x] List of proposal-card\n  [x] Pagination\n\nAll Teams:\n  [x] Page title + Create Team btn\n  [x] Search/filter bar\n  [x] Count label\n  [x] List of team-card\n\nShared across all list pages:\n  [x] Nav bar (logged-in avatar)\n  [x] Sub-nav tabs (active tab varies)\n  [x] Footer with partner logos\n\n========================\nFOOTER (footer-main)\n========================\nReusable component used on all pages.\nLogos (from /images/logos/):\n  - sdsc-logo-footer.svg\n  - eth-zurich.svg\n  - epfl.svg\nText links: Privacy · Terms · About · GitHub\n\n========================\nLIGHT MODE VARIANTS\n========================\nDesktop light: frames homepage-light and\nhackathon-loggedin-light (theme { mode: light }).\nMobile light: homepage-light-mobile and\nhackathon-loggedin-light-mobile. All $color\nvariables resolve to light values in those frames.\n\n========================\nIMAGE ASSETS USED\n========================\nHero bg:\n  /images/hackathon-ord-2024/ambiance/\n  ambiance_1.jpg\n\nCarousel:\n  ambiance_1.jpg, ambiance_3.jpg,\n  winners_1.jpg, teams_1.jpg\n\nLogos:\n  sdsc-logo-footer.svg\n  eth-zurich.svg\n  epfl.svg"
    }
  ],
